    "text": "In <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msub></math> , the number of oxygen atoms bonded to each phosphorus atoms are respectively‐",
